<title>USA: Mississippi puts $79.74 mln GO deal on notice.</title>
<headline>Mississippi puts $79.74 mln GO deal on notice.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mississippi will sell $79.74 million of general obligation refunding bonds by competitive bid with 24 hours notice, the State Bond Commission said Friday.</p>
<p>The issue will have maturities out to 2014 and will refund the state's Series 1994B Capital Improvement Bonds and its Series F Major Economic Impact bonds.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
